  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "two-person rivalry",
  "premise": "Two neighbors compete to practice music more quietly, progressing from padded drums to finger taps to invisible performances. Their silent showdown accidentally attracts a crowd of readers, and they turn the rivalry into a silent concert with caption cards and choreographed bows.",
